## Inlines

*italic* · **bold** · ***bold italic*** · ~~struck~~ · `code` · $x^2 + y^2$

Escapes: \*not emphasis\* · \`not code\` · \$not math\$ · \[not a link\] ·
\\backslash · \|not a cell divider\|

Flanking near-misses: `a * b * c` · `5 * 4 * 3` · `costs $5 and $10` ·
`$HOME and $PATH` · `intra*word*em` emphasizes · `**"quoted"**` emphasizes

Links: [inline](https://ziglang.org) · <https://ziglang.org> ·
https://ziglang.org · [to a document](markdown.md) ·
[to an anchor](markdown.md#lists) · [/site-absolute](/example) untouched

Spans: [accent].color(accent) · [muted].color(muted) · [fg].color(fg) ·
[**bold** inside a span].color(accent)

Image: ![the strike logo](logo.svg)

## Lists

- dash bullet
* star bullet

+ plus bullet

1. ordered
2. items

. raw list
. no markers

- [ ] unchecked
- [x] checked
- [X] also checked

- nesting
  - two columns is enough
	- a tab counts as four

- item text
  wrapping onto a second line
- a plain line after an item

  lazily continues it

