## Alerts

> [!NOTE]
> note

> [!TIP]
> tip

> [!IMPORTANT]
> important

> [!WARNING]
> warning

> [!CAUTION]
> caution

> [!TODO]
> todo

> [!EXAMPLE]
> example

> [!QUESTION]
> question

> [!IDEA] unknown type — a plain quote with literal text

> [!note] lowercase matches; body on the marker line

## Quotes

> one paragraph
> flowing across lines
>
> a second paragraph
lazily continued from outside

> - a list inside a quote is literal text
> # so is a heading

