## Math

Inline $e^{i\pi} + 1 = 0$, single-line display:

$$ \sum_{n=1}^{\infty} \frac{1}{n^2} = \frac{\pi^2}{6} $$

And multi-line:

$$
\int_{-\infty}^{\infty} e^{-x^2}\,dx = \sqrt{\pi}
$$

## Layout

// gallery_grid grid(2)

**A table in a grid cell**

| a | b |
| --- | --- |
| 1 | 2 |

// --

/skinny(70%)

A skinny paragraph in the right cell — different commands, so they nest.

// end gallery_grid

// gallery_wide wide(130%)

// inner_grid grid(3)

**Wide**

A grid inside a wide group.

// --

**Three**

Different commands at every level.

// --

**Columns**

Nothing here repeats a command.

// end inner_grid

// end gallery_wide

/center()

Centered.

/indent(2)

An indented paragraph, first line only.

// gallery_collapse collapse()

**A collapsed group**

Folded until opened.

// end gallery_collapse
